Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,get help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning bright for what's ahead you\Nsee is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The best that we know. With tears\Nand doubts and tone. We'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.26,0:01:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,where we all wanna go The page\Nwithin brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.74,0:02:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all take that kind\Nof... You help me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.14,0:02:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, master, I'm ready Your\Nenemies shall taste my righteous fury
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.64,0:02:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,General Hamlet has lost his damn mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.14,0:02:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem, Master, I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help Team Bay, I'll\Nhandle the underlings!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can pound the crap out of\Nwho's who. Hey, poker! What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, Snowhack can\Nloosen us on his side!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the second\Nfloor inside the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The gifters are joining the sunrise!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that was amazing Tama thanks tsunami your\Nplan worked out perfectly you asked every
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.88,0:03:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,gifter on the island\Nto lend a paw they did
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and now we have a whole zoo full of backup
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.80,0:03:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,you really did save the\Nday you know proud of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you i'm glad you were\Nhere thank you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.13,0:03:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And we beat those dumb lizards too Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we're the best
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did that bread\Nactually do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, look out! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:04:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Judge's boy is back for more!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever say that\Nname in front of me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me how you know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you part of that mad scientist group?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.05,0:05:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean mads?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ancient history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to see real science.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,take a look at this i'm a cyborg
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,boy i kind of figured without\NNow you're spelling it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We are so dead now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Quaine is busting out his man-beast form!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:06:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look-a-here, a cyborg expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.26,0:06:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,See what good it does you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.00,0:06:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, how's Mosshead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Think he's gonna pull through this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, Shaggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good, but are\Nyou doing okay, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, very kind of you to ask,\Nmy boy, but I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tuckered out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This form has a side effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I used the Rumble Ball too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a drug we could\Nuse, but it's risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, at least let me hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a medicine we minks have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.64,0:06:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anyone can use it,\Nbut it comes from Zou.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It heals even the most severe\Nwounds, and it does so rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, once a bit of time has passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll suffer twice as much\Nas he's suffering now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very least, I can't make\Nthat choice while he's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me the truck already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Garo, were listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to debate about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the drugs so I can fight
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning this battle is the\Nonly thing that matters
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens to my body\Nlater I need to go fight right now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The headliners and the gifters\Nwho went over to the Saburai
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,army only number about 300 But\Ntheir power is considerable
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can only assume that the\Ngirl who got on stage at the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,performance floor is responsible\NThey seem to be following her,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but we haven't been able to determine why.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.94,0:07:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You crap! Don't look back! Keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for that stunt, you punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how well your dirty tricks\Nwork on our men after we kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you meddling little freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.37,0:08:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.29,0:08:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're after Thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Murdering children now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.88,0:08:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those scumbags give\Ndecent pirates a bad name!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Tama, I'll protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave you! I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You two go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up after I kick their butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Headliner coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Scorpion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Death needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The poison's already\Nflowing through your veins!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Daifugo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.54,0:08:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.08,0:09:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid work on the\Noperation. Now hop on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll carry you from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sorselina.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been doing an\Nawful lot of running.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, take me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I come bearing news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.82,0:09:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've found Komachiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll figure it out later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.98,0:09:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But either way, it looks like\Nit's time to get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.06,0:09:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Blight signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Arabesque Rig Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is what you\Ncall iron body, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the fighting style\Nused by government agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The six powers, if I recall correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm reminded of a rumor I heard ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about an intelligence agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone from CP9 escaping from prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's strange, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they send an\Nintelligence agent to prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny you'd remember\Nsuch a tiny little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:11:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But yes your instincts are right\Nthat agent it was me. Do you and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.58,0:11:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,i know each other because i I\Ncan't seem to recall you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you once, but you wouldn't\Nhave taken notice of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in CP9 at the time, and you were\None of the seven warlords of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Life has taken us both in\Ndifferent directions since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a complaint exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite content with where I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, I suffered\Na lot to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to one school of 13 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was an extraordinary\Ntalent as promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,as the brilliant rob\Nlucci they said you're
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,telling me this but it\Ndoesn't seem to have
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.02,0:11:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,anything to do with me\Nshut up just listen damn it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the six\Npowers used like that, but at
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.46,0:12:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,any rate as I told you your\Ntragic past has nothing to do
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,with me I disagree hmm you're\Nwith Straw Hat aren't you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you proudly proclaimed that\Nyou were a member of his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Anytime someone mentions Straw\NHat's name, it drags up some bad
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.46,0:12:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.37,0:12:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,13 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,a Devil Fruit was stolen while it\Nwas being transported on a government
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,ship. Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,about two years back, when Straw Hat Luffy\Nrose to prominence, I received quite the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.18,0:12:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That stolen item that\Ncaused me so much suffering
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Was none other than Straw\NHat's Gum-Gum fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.68,0:13:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kumatsiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he'll pull through!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Griselina, can you hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.58,0:13:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make our way to Kumachi\Nand keep him safe, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.46,0:13:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for being so nice to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know it's dangerous out\Nthere, so you two be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We all have to make it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you guys are my friends\Nand I'm scared about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.37,0:13:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She cares about us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll serve our master well!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way for the master!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:14:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That power of hers is\Nreally something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she can make friends anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And powerful ones, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, by the way, since\NI'm here, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,For us, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I be your assistant like before?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.74,0:14:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking\Nabout, Zeus? No way! Aww!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But how about partners?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of the Straw Hats! Cut them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with my partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, she has him wrapped around\Nher little finger already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Down with Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The master needs our help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.66,0:14:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to lead the Samurai to victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.30,0:15:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,About 2,000 of our fighters\Nhave changed sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Another 2,000 were blindsided by the\Nbetrayal and have been defeated by the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Putting that in perspective,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the Beast Pirates initially had 30,000\Ntroops before losing 10,000 in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.76,0:15:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,These losses are in addition to\Nthe ones I mentioned earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So we've lost 14,000 total.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.98,0:15:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes it 16,000 versus 9,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If the gifters keep this up, we'll see\Nmore white than black on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care which side comes out on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as our escaped\Nconvict is silenced for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're certain it's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.06,0:15:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if that's the case, the\Ninformation he possesses is old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It poses no threat to the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:15:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but we have to set a precedent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who escape our organization\Ncannot be allowed to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the problem will\Nlikely take care of itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He is fighting Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This might get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grudge is pointless. What\Ndoes Luffy have to do with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,this i hold a grudge with\Nthe man who stole the Gum-Gum
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.16,0:16:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,fruit which is the pirate\Nred-haired shanks that bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,he caused me all that suffering\Nand doesn't even have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonwalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.64,0:16:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fang Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Captain King, you're\Nwearing Shanks' Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.68,0:17:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,shamed me by flaunting\Nthe powers of the stolen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.84,0:17:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Fruit. So of course,\Nhe inherited my grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,what's wrong Haki can't block my attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.78,0:17:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,actually that's a smart decision those can
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,chew through argument\Nliterally i'm surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,to see you move so quickly on land not bad
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For a fisherman, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.94,0:17:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.42,0:17:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tired old racism?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we were past that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, there's something\NI wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron body!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to suffer, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And last!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman jujitsu, low tide, shoulder throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.82,0:18:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Water shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you're merciless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, time out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.70,0:19:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Pal, can you give me a break\Nfor just one damn minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There was this story I heard\Nwhen I was behind bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As I was being tortured, the guard\Nmockingly told me to pray for salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.54,0:19:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pray to the sun god, Nika.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's like a hero to slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.80,0:19:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a legendary warrior who fought\Nfor freedom in ancient times prophesized
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.80,0:19:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to return and liberate the enslaved\NI don't know if he really existed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.02,0:19:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but they say he would\Ndeliver folks from suffering
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.82,0:19:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,with a smile on his face\NIt was a strange story,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but I held on to it in\Nthose seemingly endless days
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.80,0:19:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter who just\Nsaved me. I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:20:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And what answers do you hope to find\Nfrom me? I heard a rumor about some
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,of the sun pirates you used to lead\Nquite a few of them used to be slaves
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.22,0:20:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the history of fishmen\Nis a history of slavery
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.06,0:20:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,turns out the guard who told me\Nabout nika was later executed
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they might come for me next,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.42,0:20:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so I risked everything to\Nget the hell out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.62,0:20:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it dangerous to speak his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but be curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you hiding?\NTell me! Take a pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.26,0:20:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Toretti, shark grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.98,0:21:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.22,0:21:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I really struck a nerve, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.58,0:21:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I 'LL CRUSH YOU, MY PISTOL!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.72,0:21:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.44,0:21:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate Secret Art! Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.26,0:21:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's my tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon's Blackness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.42,0:22:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You learn your mouth about this\Nlike it's some sort of game!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.90,0:22:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the weight of history!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now?
